{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Ratatata</i> is an isometric Tower Defense game where you lead a space rat kingdom fending off a ruthless cat invasion! Fight across diverse environments and adapt your strategies to survive the relentless waves of these fierce felines!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 24 <i>racruits</i> divided into 6 families. Each unit bears a name that begins with the syllable <strong>&quot;Ra-&quot;</strong>. Their weapons and powers are directly derived from this. For example, the <strong>Rapier</strong> fights with rapiers, the <strong>Ragout</strong> cooks delicious meals to strengthen allies, and the <strong>Radioactive</strong> spreads a deadly gas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your enemies, the <strong>Cats</strong>, also draw their powers from their names, which begin with the syllable <strong>&quot;Cha-&quot;</strong>, such as the <strong>Carpenter</strong>, the <strong>Shaman</strong>, or even the fearsome <strong>Chardasso</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680090?t=1746703982","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680090/e2e22c9772689f91a7130a4de9882d401d9a1f84/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746703982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680090/10617b344bdcaa83f6c170f3f4876d41d76975fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746703982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680090/10617b344bdcaa83f6c170f3f4876d41d76975fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746703982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Ratatata</i> is an isometric Tower Defense game where you lead a space rat kingdom fending off a ruthless cat invasion! Fight across diverse environments and adapt your strategies to survive the relentless waves of these fierce felines!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 24 <i>racruits</i> divided into 6 families. Each unit bears a name that begins with the syllable <strong>&quot;Ra-&quot;</strong>. Their weapons and powers are directly derived from this. For example, the <strong>Rapier</strong> fights with rapiers, the <strong>Ragout</strong> cooks delicious meals to strengthen allies, and the <strong>Radioactive</strong> spreads a deadly gas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your enemies, the <strong>Cats</strong>, also draw their powers from their names, which begin with the syllable <strong>&quot;Cha-&quot;</strong>, such as the <strong>Carpenter</strong>, the <strong>Shaman</strong>, or even the fearsome <strong>Chardasso</strong>!</p>","developers":["La Ratatateam"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680090/e570dafbe8019d0d8426043a8531b31d1c566789/header.jpg?t=1746703982","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136776,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136776/movie480.mp4?t=1746703980","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136776/movie_max.mp4?t=1746703980"},"name":"Ratatata v1.4.2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136776/48b32bc4bb0a718ac075fad4f394046e23c73a57/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746703980","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136776/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746703980","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136776/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746703980"}}],"name":"Ratatata","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong